          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div style="width: 300px; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 50px;">
            <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">IEX=0.63</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">NORTHEAST</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div style="width: 300px; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 50px;">
            <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">IEX=0.66</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">WEST</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <div style="width: 300px; height: 200px; background-color: #eee; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
          <div style="text-align: center; padding-top: 50px;">
            <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">IEX=0.51</div>
            <div style="font-size: 10pt;">SOUTH</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; height: 150px;">
