  <h2>Entrepreneurship</h2>

  <p>Entrepreneurship has become a cross-campus phenomenon at many community colleges in the last decade, and not just in business schools. For example, Lansing Community College is one of the largest community colleges in our area of Lansing, Michigan - offer entrepreneurship programs and activities to students across campus from any major (see more at <span data-field="lcc_url">{{ lcc_url }}</span>).</p>

  <p>We assessed two entrepreneurship issues: (1) existence of an entrepreneurship program and (2) top level commitment of the community college to entrepreneurship.</p>

